     C                   endif
    C*
    C*  PROCESS UNTIL NO MORE SUBMISSION REQUESTS.
    C*
     C                   dow       *in50 = *off
     C                   move      shfyr         xxfyr
    C*
    C*  BYPASS PENDED SUBMISSIONS.
    C*
     C                   if        shstat = '1'
     C                   goto      next
     C                   endif
    C*
    C*  Bypass mass policy page requests that do not match received timestamp.
    C*
     C                   If        zzemp# = 0 and polStamp <> ' ' and
     C                             polStamp <> SHRun
     C                   Goto      next
     C                   Endif
    C*
    C*  BYPASS IF THE EMPLOYER HAS BEEN PROCESSED BEFORE RESUBMISSION
    C*
