     C                   clear                   qqerr
      *

     C                   call      'SRDDIF8'
     C                   parm                    qqfrom
     C                   parm                    qqto
     C                   parm                    qqdays
     C                   parm                    qqerr
      *
     C                   if        qqerr = *blanks
    C*
    C*  SUBTRACT 1 FROM 1ST ANNIV PERIOD IF IT IS LEAP YEAR AND
    C*  FEBRUARY 29 FALLS WITHIN THE FIRST PERIOD.
    C*
     C                   if        xxlpdt <> 0
