    C*
     C                   endif
    C*
     C                   move      ' '           xfname
     C                   eval      xfnlkc = 0
     C                   eval      xfencd = 0
    C*
     C                   if        writfd = 'Y'
    C*
    C* UPDATE NAME/ADDRESS RCD WITH EARLIEST/LATEST POL EFF/EXP DATES.
    C*
    C* - Division Federal Name
    C*
     C     naky          chain     pna01                              60
    C*
     C                   dow       *in60 = *off
    C*
    C* Create long (100) names from 2 fields
     C                   exsr      crtlna
    C*
     C                   if        xna100 = xxf100
     C                             and nafein = emfein
     C                             and rsjrst <> 'NJ'
     c                             and  xxpeon <> 'Y'
     c
     C                             or  NANAM4  = XXNAM4
     C                             and nafein = emfein
     C                             and rsjrst <> 'NJ'
     c                             and  xxpeon = 'Y'
     c
     C                             or NANAM4  =  XXNAM4
     C                             and rsjrst = 'NJ'
     c                             and xxpeon = 'Y'
     C                             or xna100 = xxf100
     C                             and rsjrst = 'NJ'
     c                             and xxpeon <> 'Y'
    C*
     C                   Eval      xxchg = ' '
     C                   Exsr      updDivDates
    C*
     C                   If        xxchg = 'Y'
     C                   Update    pna01
    C*
    C* Update any other records for same name as well.
    C*
     C     naky1         Reade     pna01                                  60
    C*
     C                   Dow       *in60 = *off
    C*
     C                   If        naname <> *blanks
     C                   Eval      xxchg = ' '
     C                   Exsr      updDivDates
    C*
     C                   If        xxchg = 'Y'
     C                   Update    pna01
     C                   Endif
    C*
     C                   Endif
    C*
     C     naky1         Reade     pna01                                  60
     C                   Enddo
     C*
     C                   Endif
    C*
     C                   move      *on           *in60
     C                   endif
    C*
     C                   if        *in60 = *off
     C     naky          reade     pna01                                  60
     C                   endif
    C*
     C                   enddo
    C*
    C* Update federal name now for ue# and set flags.
