     C                   Endif
     C                   Enddo
    C*
    C* Update dba name now for ue# and set flags.
    C*
     C                   move      ' '           xsname
     c                   move      *off          *in61
     C     naky          chain     pna01                              60
     C                   dow       *in60 = *off
    C*
     C                   EXSR      CRTLNA
     C                   if        XNA100 = XXN100
     C                             and NAFEIN = EMFEIN
     C                             and rsjrst <> 'NJ'
     c                             and  xxpeon <> 'Y'
     c
     C                             or NANAM4  = XXNAM4
