     C                   Eval      nanlkc = xfnlkc
     C                   Endif
     C*
     C                   MOVE      EMTPOB        NALEGN
     C                   endsl
    C*
     C                   move      emfein        nafein
     C                   move      '2'           namadt
    C*
    C*    Load these fields only if WCFL14='Y'
