     C* Add declaration page when configured. Policies written in
     C* CA or have CA coverage are covered above.
     C*
     C                   If        xxListDec =  'Y' and *in75 = *off and
     C                             xxCAst <> 'Y'
     C*
     C                   Eval      endsForm = %trim(xxDecForm2)
     C*
     C                   If        declareForm <> ' '
     C                   Eval      endsForm = declareForm
     C                   Endif
     C*
     C                   If        declareDesc = ' '
     C                   Eval      declareDesc = xxfd01a
     C                   Endif
     C*
     C                   If        declareDate = 0
     C                   Eval      declareDate = xxDecDate
     C                   Endif
     C*
     C                   Eval      ENEddt = declareDate
     C     endsForm      cat(p)    '(':0         endsForm
     C                   cat       xxedmm:0      endsForm
     C                   cat       '/':0         endsForm
     C                   cat       xxedyy:0      endsForm
     C                   cat       ')':0         endsForm
    C*
     C                   Eval      mudsc2 = %trim(declareDesc)
    C*
     C                   Exsr      ScriptForms
    C*
     C                   Endif
     C
    C* Add Additional Named Insured form.
    C*
     C                   Eval      muenst = '  '
     C                   eval      xxEnSt = '**'
     C                   If        xxanam = 'Y'
    C*
     C                   Eval      endsForm = %trim(xxDecForm2)
