    C*
    C********************************************************************
    C*     Print/Merge any Endorsement Forms that have been attached
    C*     to the policy that are system generated.
    C********************************************************************
    C*
    C*     Clear WXICP
    C*
     C                   call      'W7413C3'
     C                   parm      *Blanks       qqrtcd
    C*
    C*     Open WXICP
    C*
     C                   open      wxicp
    C*
    C*     If OV Installed....
    C*
     C                   if        syofif = 'Y'
    C*
    C*     Include the Policy Page. If CM fields blank, use default
    C*
     C                   if        cmdcid = *blanks
     C                             or cmfold = *blanks
