     C                   move      qqemp#        xxemp#
     C                   move      qqdiv         xxdiv
     C                   move      qqfyr         xxfyr
     C                   Call      'SRCHKPGM'                           99
     C                   Parm      'W7051C1'     XXPGM            10
     C                   Parm                    XXERR             1
     C     XXERR         Ifeq      '1'
     C                   Eval      QQReis = 'Y'
     C                   Endif
     C                   if        qqreis = 'Y'
     C                   move      *on           *in24
     C                   endif
    C*
    C*  GET THE FUND MASTER - FORMAT THE ADDRESS
    C*
     C     fnky          chain     pfn01                              60
     C     fnky          chain     pf201                              60
     C                   Z-add     F2Car#        svCar#
     C                   move      *off          *in31
      *
     C                   if        (cltid = '093')

     C                   if        (xxfnd = 790) or
