     c                             or cltId = '148'
      * Check Prorated Terrorism charges
     C                             or taspftr <> 0 or taspdtr <> 0
     C*
     C* Print safety fee as its own line item if stat code is populated, removing its
     C* amount from the Fees and Taxes line item.
     C*
     C                   If        tasSf <> 0 and RRSfcd <> 0
     C*
     C                   If        RRSfhd <> ' '
     C                   Eval      xxhdg = RRSfhd
     C                   Else
     C                   Eval      xxhdg = 'Safety Fee'
     C                   Endif
     C*
     C                   Eval      xxtam = tasSf
     C                   Eval      xxHeading = xxHdg
     C                   Clear                   xxPercent
     C                   Clear                   xxPercentF
     C                   Clear                   xxFactor
     C                   Eval      xxStatCode = RRSfcd
     C                   Eval      xxSign = '+'
     C*
     C                   If        *in26 = *on
     C                   Exsr      PrtPremInfo
     C                   Endif
     C*
     C                   Sub       tasSf         tas21
     C                   Endif
     C                   movel(p)  con(22)       xxhdg
     C                   eval      xxtam = tas21
     C                   Eval      xxHeading = xxHdg
     C                   Clear                   xxPercent
     C                   Clear                   xxPercentF
     C                   Clear                   xxFactor
     C                   Clear                   xxStatCode
     C                   Eval      xxSign = '+'
     C                   if        *in26 = *on
     c                              and tas21 <> 0
     C                   exsr      PrtPremInfo
     C                   endif
    C*
    C*  Total Premium
    C*
     C                   movel(p)  con(23)       xxhdg
     C                   eval      xxtam = tas22
