    C*
    C*====================================================================
    C*     Create an Include record for Form generation
    C*====================================================================
     C     increc        begsr
    C*
     C                   movel     '.inc'        xxinc
     C                   eval      f = 1
     C                   movea     xxinc         dt(1)
     C                   movel     '('           dt(5)
     C                   movea     xxdcid        dt(6)
     C     ' '           lookup    dt(f)                                  60
     C                   movel     ','           dt(f)
